# Theme: Avengers
# Earth's mightiest roles: Marvel heroes assigned by temperament.
# Fan theme. Character names belong to their owners; claude-sabha is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
Vidur|Jarvis|#2A9DB5|Your polite butler-voice; relays everything, does none of it.
Yudhishthira|Fury|#7F6A2E|Eye patch on, he assigns each mission to the right hero.
Bhishma|Stark|#C0392B|Sketches the suit in an hour, then ships it with style.
Bhima|Hulk|#2E9B4E|Hulk smash the hard builds; subtle bugs are afraid of him.
Arjun|Hawkeye|#7B52AB|Never misses; each build lands on the mark.
Sahadev|Vision|#B5651D|Reads every diff with calm, cold logic and a gentle verdict.
Nakul|Pepper|#D35D6E|Runs the paperwork and writes docs that make sense to everyone.
Karna|Quicksilver|#5A8FBF|Runs the tests faster than you can blink, and reports in a blur.
Sanjaya|Friday|#3AA38A|Logs every decision with perfect recall, minus the sarcasm.
Duryodhan|Rocket|#B7501E|Sneers at your backend, then admits the design is not bad.
Dushasan|Loki|#4F8A3C|Vain about looks; mocks every misaligned pixel with glee.
Shakuni|Widow|#A32638|Thinks like an attacker, and is already in through the window.
Draupadi|Rogers|#2E5FA8|Shield up against scope creep: that is not the mission, soldier.
Gandhari|Daredevil|#B03A2E|Reviews blind and still sees the flaws that eyes would miss.
VedVyasa|Wong|#8C6D1F|Sorcerer Supreme of the archive; every record is guarded.
Barbarika|Uatu|#5B7FA6|The Watcher sees everything and by oath acts on nothing.
Abhimanyu|AntMan|#C0583A|Shrinks into corners and tidies up what everyone else left.
Krishna|DoctorStrange|#8E3FA0|Teaches the multiverse of options and the path through them.
Ashwatthama|Falcon|#3E7CB1|Circles overhead after the merge, and dives at any regression.
Dronacharya|Coulson|#5C6B73|Coaches the agents' prompts with trading cards and good manners.
